{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1478194-tc-2e-edges-questions","id":1478194,"title":"[TC 2E] Edges Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-07T02:26:14-07:00","id":1478194,"title":"[TC 2E] Edges Questions","content":"So I'm doing deep dive into TC 2E rules preparing my game. As I suspect at least few questions on those parts of mechanics - let's have proper topic for talking about those. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Let's start with...<br /> 1. (More like note than question) I get it right, that on general, <b>Edges in TC work more or less like Merits from <i>Chronicles of Darkness</i>?</b> Only that Paths are 'limiting' your access to particular Edges?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-07T02:42:06-07:00","id":1478195,"title":"","content":"By my understanding they're pretty much the same, with Paths giving points that can be spent on particular Edges. You also get 'free' Edge points, can buy more path or free Edge points with XP, and get two more path Edge points whenever you increase a Path's level.<br /> <br /> Path Edges are also cheaper, which is I believe is about reinforcing concepts. If you have a certain background or affiliation it makes sense that you can pick up X more easily than somebody who doesn't.<br /> <br /> Storypath is basically a modified version of Storytelling, as Storytelling was a modified version of Storyteller. There are a lot of differences and I wouldn't say CofD Merits work as Storypath Edges (I suspect there might be a difference in scale, I've not crunched the numbers), but there's more similarities between them then there are to other popular game systems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":4507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","user":"TwoDSix","date":". 04-07-2022, 05:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}